    "body": "## Motivation\n\n`--kt-num-gpu-experts 0` keeps every routed expert on the CPU. `KTEPWrapperMethod.apply` still calls the GPU method with the masked dispatch, which then holds zero experts. For DeepSeek-V4 / V4.1 (MXFP4 experts, FlashInfer runner), that call fails: the runner refuses a zero-expert workspace. Even where it succeeds, it launches a MoE over no experts on every layer for an all-zero result.\n\n## Modifications\n\n`python/sglang/srt/layers/moe/kt_ep_wrapper.py`: with `num_gpu_experts == 0`, skip the GPU method and start from `torch.zeros_like(x)`. The CPU result is added to it as before (tp rank 0), so the output is the CPU experts' sum.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nDeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 on 2x RTX 5070 Ti, TP2, `--kt-num-gpu-experts 0`. The CPU experts run on 2x EPYC 7452 with kt-kernel 0.7.0. The server loads (`GPU experts per layer: 0`) and answers a chat request coherently. The non-zero path is unchanged.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nOnly the zero-expert configuration changes: one MoE launch less per layer.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [ ] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01C2UBZdnrDZSBh8yQz8rc9g\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39263861812](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39263861812)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39263861776](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39263861776)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39263861817](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39263861817)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
